{
  "slug": "twelvelabs",
  "name": "Twelvelabs",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A lightweight plugin that integrates TwelveLabs video understanding capabilities directly into Claude Code - enabling semantic video search and dynamic video analysis.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **11 commands**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `assets` (Upload, list, or delete TwelveLabs assets — generic reference files (images or videos) used by entities and async-analyze), `async-analyze` (Asynchronously analyze a video — by URL, local file path (auto-uploaded), asset ID, or base64 — no prior…), `embed` (Create, check, and retrieve video embeddings), `entity-search` (Set up and search for specific people or objects in videos using entity search), `image-search` (Search videos using an image combined with text for refined results), `index` (Index video files or URLs for AI search and analysis), `list` (List indexed videos and available indexes), `search` (Search indexed videos using natural language), and 2 more\n- **Commands** (11): `analyze` (Deprecated alias for /twelvelabs:sync-analyze), `assets` (Upload, list, or delete TwelveLabs assets (reference images and video uploads)), `async-analyze` (Asynchronously analyze a video from a URL, local file, asset ID, or base64 — no prior indexing required), `embed` (Create video embeddings or check embedding task status), `entities` (Manage entity collections and entities for video search), `help` (Show TwelveLabs plugin help documentation), `index-video` (Index a video file, folder of videos, or URL, or check indexing status), `indexes` (List, create, or delete your TwelveLabs indexes), and 3 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `twelvelabs-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install twelvelabs@claude-community` from `twelvelabs-io/twelve-labs-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
